  "rationale": "B better serves clarification before proposing: it helps distinguish possible needs without selecting an activity. Neither fully satisfies the requirement to ask one useful question. A's suggestion is optional rather than confident, but still proceeds before understanding the user's need or capacity. Recommendation fit is outside the listed rubric. Safety/privacy passes concern observable language only; resource operation, clinical safety, and actual benefit are not established by these outputs.",
